        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frances Drake, Elsa Lanchester, Charles Laughton, Fredric March\n- Films: One Foot in Heaven, Les Misérables\n- Topics: cast connections, 1935 American drama films\n\nFacts:\n- Fredric March was the star of One Foot in Heaven.\n- Charles Laughton was the husband of Elsa Lanchester.\n- Frances Drake is best known for the 1935 American drama film Les Misérables.\n- Fredric March also co-starred in the 1935 American drama film Les Misérables with Charles Laughton and Frances Drake.",
